                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Together, the subcommittee chairs have worked alongside Chairman Cole to ensure that, as appropriators, we remain committed to fiscal responsibility and transparency through regular order. As Chairman of\u00a0the\u00a0Labor, Health and Human Services, and Education Subcommittee, I am especially proud of this bill for balancing careful financial stewardship while maintaining key investments in biomedical research, schools, and public health.\u00a0We can Make America Great Again by making America fiscally responsible again.",
