                "text": "On Day 38 of the shutdown, Redstone Arsenal\u2019s Fox Army Health Center will be reducing services. Another direct consequence of Democrats refusing to open the government.\n\nThe health center will prioritize active-duty personnel\u2019s primary care, while reducing Primary Care Medical Home services and suspending all on-post radiology services.\u00a0Non-urgent primary care, along with all radiology services, will be diverted to the Tricare network.\n\nFor more information:\nhttps://t.co/Nqd86j0Zko",
